<title>USA: Insurance Auto Auctions Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Insurance Auto Auctions Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>PALATINE, Ill. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.07     loss	$ 0.20</p>
<p> Net profit		   751     loss	 2,247</p>
<p> Revs			68,680		   64,982</p>
